What are the final values of `x` and `y`?

```c
int *ptr1, *ptr2, x, y;
x = 8;
ptr2 = &x;
ptr1 = NULL;
*ptr2 = 10;
y = *ptr2 + 3;
ptr1 = ptr2;
*ptr1 = 100;
ptr1 = &y;
*ptr1 = 80;
```

